# UI icons — no emoji chrome

Do **not** use emoji as icons in product UI (nav, badges, buttons, empty states, section titles, stats, FABs, filter chips, modal headers).

Use stroke SVGs from `src/components/UiIcons.js` (re-exports `HeaderNavIcons` + `ForumIcons` + extras).

## Style

- `currentColor`, stroke 1.75, round caps/joins, 24×24 viewBox
- Match existing `header-nav-icon` look
- Add new icons to `UiIcons.js` rather than inventing one-offs or emoji

## Exceptions

- User-generated content bodies
- Email copy
- Intentional pixel sprites (header cat / My Cat art)
- Legacy stored banner/hit-topic emoji fields — public UI must still render SVG

Full rule: `docs/overview/UI-ICON-SYSTEM.md`
